    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Important Rules:\n\tTraps only affect the murderer \u2013 Use them strategically
    to slow down or escape.\n\tThe murderer can only attack victims \u2013 Stay hidden,
    use traps wisely, and work together to survive.\n\tDoors can be a key advantage
    \u2013 Block paths or mislead the murderer to gain time.\n\tThe flashlight can
    help, but it also reveals your position \u2013 Use it carefully in dark areas.\n\tMurderer\u2019s
    highlight ability ([X]) \u2013 Can reveal all victims' positions but has a cooldown,
    so use it wisely."
